    "prefix": "Common source x plus actual attention(input_layernorm(x)); shared source tail input cotangent",
    "staged_vs_full": "Every variant tail receives the fixed captured named r and every variant prefix receives the fixed captured named ct_r. These are not each variant's own composed-chain intermediates/cotangents. Differences against full conflate fixed-boundary operand substitution, dtype and fusion/materialization; this is not a pure fusion test.",
    "tail": "Common source r plus actual MLP(post_attention_layernorm(r)); shared source suffix cotangent"
  },
